  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: takes a bare path and infers the kind — .fsproj, a single .fs, .fsx, .sln/.slnx, a directory or a glob. Scripts skip MSBuild entirely. Multi-targeted and strong-named projects now work. Files are typechecked in parallel (--jobs, default 4). New rules FR0090-FR0093; several false positives fixed.",
